ata-start=\"401\" data-end=\"443\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"404\" data-end=\"443\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"\u003eMr. Sneeze\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"486\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"486\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"\u003eMr. Bump\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"529\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"490\" data-end=\"529\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"\u003eMr. Snow\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"572\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"572\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"\u003eMr. Messy\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"615\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"576\" data-end=\"615\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"\u003eMr. Topsy-Turvy\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"698\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"698\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"\u003eMr. Silly\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\" data-testid=\"webpage-citation-pill\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\" data-testid=\"webpage-citation-pill\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ol\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"818\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"\u003eEach book is approximately 32 pages long, featuring vibrant illustrations and simple, engaging stories that convey moral lessons in a fun and accessible way.\u003c\/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"\u003eThe sturdy hardcover format ensures durability, making it suitable for repeated readings by young children.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1229\"\u003eAuthor: Roger Hargreaves\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1263\"\u003eFormat: Hardcover Box Set\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1296\"\u003ePages: 32 pages per book\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1325\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45654591635609,"sku":"14RA9780843198355","price":80.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/11335227.jpg?v=1755621914"},{"product_id":"rich-dad-classics-boxed-set-by-robert-t-kiyosaki","title":"Rich Dad Classics Boxed Set by Robert T. Kiyosaki","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"159\" data-end=\"424\"\u003eMoney doesn’t come with instructions, but Robert T. Kiyosaki has spent decades changing the way people think about it. The Rich Dad Classics Boxed Set brings together his most influential works, packaged for anyone ready to take control of their financial future.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"798\"\u003eInside these books, you’ll discover why the rich think differently, how to escape the trap of working for money, and how to start making money work for you. Kiyosaki’s straightforward, eye-opening approach blends personal stories with practical advice, making complex ideas about investing, assets, and financial independence easy to understand and impossible to ignore.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"1087\"\u003eWhether you’re just starting your financial journey or looking to sharpen your money mindset, this set is a powerful toolkit for building wealth, breaking old habits, and creating freedom. It’s not just about getting rich—it’s about changing the way you see the world of money forever.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"1087\"\u003eAuthor: Robert T. Kiyosaki\u003cbr data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1205\"\u003eISBN: 9781612680156\u003cbr data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1227\"\u003eFormat: Paperback box set\u003cbr data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1255\"\u003ePages: \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45732494540953,"sku":"4RA9781612680156","price":60.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/85_661387_000__101__01.jpg?v=1758271448"},{"product_id":"read-it-yourself-with-ladybird-level-1-collection","title":"Read It Yourself with Ladybird – Level 1 Collection(15 Books)","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"449\"\u003eSmall stories. Big confidence. Endless smiles. 💫\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"685\"\u003eMeet the magical world of Read It Yourself with Ladybird – Level 1, where classic tales and modern favourites are rewritten with simple words and bright pictures — perfect for children taking their very first steps into reading.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"975\"\u003eEach book is crafted with short sentences, familiar vocabulary, and gentle repetition to help young readers (ages 4–6) build confidence one page at a time. Whether it’s a hungry goat, a busy hen, or Peppa Pig exploring tiny creatures, these stories make reading time feel like playtime.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1164\"\u003eWith Ladybird’s trusted learning structure, each Level 1 story is designed to be \u003cem data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1090\"\u003eread together, then read alone\u003c\/em\u003e — the perfect way to turn early learners into proud little readers. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1164\"\u003eTITLES - \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1622\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1226\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1226\"\u003eThe Magic Porridge Pot\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1258\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1258\"\u003eThe Three Billy Goats Gruff\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1280\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1280\"\u003eThe Ugly Duckling\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1295\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1295\"\u003eCinderella\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1319\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1319\"\u003eThe Enormous Turnip\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1351\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1351\"\u003ePeppa Pig: Little Creatures\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1374\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1374\"\u003eThe Little Red Hen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1403\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1403\"\u003eThe Tale of Peter Rabbit\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1454\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1454\"\u003eTinga Tinga Tales: Why Giraffe Has a Long Neck\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1487\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1487\"\u003eTopsy and Tim: Go to the Zoo\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1505\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1505\"\u003eFairy Friends\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1540\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1540\"\u003eGoldilocks and the Three Bears\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1567\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1567\"\u003eThe Prince and the Pea\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1592\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1592\"\u003eRex the Big Dinosaur\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1622\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1622\"\u003eThe Emperor’s New Clothes\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1742\"\u003eEach one is a gem — perfect for early reading practice, bedtime storytelling, or building a beautiful first library.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45790294966425,"sku":"11RA98765756","price":150.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/IMG_20251014_173513_f31ef1aa-3bcd-44ef-a733-7c87fff38c74.jpg?v=1760449076"},{"product_id":"read-it-yourself-with-ladybird-level-2-collection","title":"Read It Yourself with Ladybird – Level 3 Collection(8 Books)","description":"\u003cp data-end=\"368\" data-start=\"273\"\u003eReading gets even more exciting with longer sentences, richer stories, and bigger adventures.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"705\" data-start=\"370\"\u003eRead It Yourself with Ladybird – Level 3 is designed for children aged 6–8 who are ready to tackle more challenging stories and develop stronger reading skills. These books feature longer paragraphs, new vocabulary, and plots that encourage independent reading, all supported by engaging illustrations that bring the stories to life.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1004\" data-start=\"707\"\u003eWhether it’s a brave knight, a runaway puppet, or an adventure on a musical island, each story helps children feel proud of reading on their own while building fluency and confidence. Perfect for bedtime, school reading, or quiet weekend moments, these books make reading an adventure every day.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1004\" data-start=\"707\"\u003eTITLES - \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1256\" data-start=\"1032\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1056\" data-start=\"1032\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1056\" data-start=\"1034\"\u003eFuri on Music Island\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1069\" data-start=\"1057\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1069\" data-start=\"1059\"\u003eRapunzel\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1107\" data-start=\"1070\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1107\" data-start=\"1072\"\u003eMoshi Monsters: Poppet Stows Away\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1134\" data-start=\"1108\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1134\" data-start=\"1110\"\u003eJack and the Beanstalk\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1153\" data-start=\"1135\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1153\" data-start=\"1137\"\u003eThe Red Knight\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1175\" data-start=\"1154\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1175\" data-start=\"1156\"\u003eHansel and Gretel\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1224\" data-start=\"1176\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1224\" data-start=\"1178\"\u003eCharlie and Lola: You Won’t Like the Present As Much As I Do\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1256\" data-start=\"1225\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1256\" data-start=\"1227\"\u003eThe Elves and the Shoemaker\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1422\" data-start=\"1258\"\u003eEach story is designed to challenge and delight young readers, encouraging a love of reading while developing essential skills for confident, independent reading.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"1443\" data-start=\"1424\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45790316986521,"sku":"11RA230987423E3","price":80.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/IMG_20251014_174007.jpg?v=1760449782"},{"product_id":"read-it-yourself-with-ladybird-level-3-collection-copy","title":"Read It Yourself with Ladybird – Level 2 Collection(16 Books)","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"274\" data-end=\"354\"\u003eReading becomes more exciting as stories get longer and adventures get bigger.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"356\" data-end=\"636\"\u003eRead It Yourself with Ladybird – Level 2 is designed for children aged 5–7 who are ready to read with growing confidence. These books feature slightly longer sentences, new vocabulary, and engaging plots, all supported by bright illustrations that help bring each story to life.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"962\"\u003eFrom fairy tales to playful animal adventures and modern favourites like Peppa Pig, each story encourages children to read independently while enjoying the thrill of following a story from start to finish. Perfect for bedtime, school reading, or quiet weekend reading time, these books make every page a joyful experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1400\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-s