\" data-end=\"1325\"\u003ePirate School\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1350\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1350\"\u003eBeauty and the Beast\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1376\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1376\"\u003eThe Three Little Pigs\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1400\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1400\"\u003eSly Fox and Red Hen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1523\"\u003eEach story is designed to help children build confidence, improve reading skills, and develop a lifelong love of books.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45790328422553,"sku":"11RA230987423","price":160.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/IMG_20251014_175130.jpg?v=1760450384"},{"product_id":"read-it-yourself-with-ladybird-level-2-collection-copy","title":"Read It Yourself with Ladybird – Level 4 Collection(7 Books)","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"306\"\u003eReading becomes a full adventure with longer stories, richer vocabulary, and more detailed plots.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"632\"\u003eRead It Yourself with Ladybird – Level 4 is designed for children aged 7–9 who are ready for more complex stories and independent reading challenges. These books feature longer paragraphs, new words, and stories that include dialogue, suspense, and humor, all supported by vivid illustrations that bring each tale to life.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"972\"\u003eWhether it’s a magical adventure, a daring quest, or a hilarious mishap, each book encourages children to read with confidence, build comprehension skills, and enjoy the thrill of finishing a full story on their own. Perfect for bedtime, school reading, or quiet weekend reading, Level 4 makes reading an exciting experience every time.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"972\"\u003eTITLES - \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1237\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1034\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1034\"\u003eHarry and the Dinosaurs United\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1080\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1080\"\u003eMoshi Monsters: Katsuma and the Art Thief\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1110\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1110\"\u003eThe Pied Piper of Hamelin\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1146\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1146\"\u003eSnow White and the Seven Dwarfs\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1167\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1167\"\u003eThe Wizard of Oz\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1214\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1214\"\u003eMoshi Monsters: Luvli and the Glump-a-Tron\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1237\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1237\"\u003eSam and the Robots\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1395\"\u003eEach story is crafted to challenge and delight young readers, encouraging a love of reading while strengthening skills for confident, independent readers.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45790352834713,"sku":"11RA230987423","price":70.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/IMG_20251014_180022.jpg?v=1760450735"},{"product_id":"peppa-pig-the-amazing-collection-1-50","title":"Peppa Pig: The Amazing Collection 1–50","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"135\" data-end=\"397\"\u003ePeppa Pig: The Amazing Collection 1–50  is a delightful paperback box set featuring 50 engaging storybooks centered around Peppa Pig and her adventures. This collection is designed to captivate young readers, offering a vibrant and educational experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"399\" data-end=\"850\"\u003eThe set includes 50 individual storybooks, each filled with colorful illustrations and simple narratives that are perfect for early readers. Some of the titles in the collection include School Play, George's Hiccups, The Picnic, Surprises, Dressing Up, Flying a Kite, Muddy Car, School Camp, Daddy Pig's Birthday, and The Rainy Day. These stories explore everyday scenarios and imaginative adventures, making them relatable and enjoyable for children.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45802506682521,"sku":"10RA09876543","price":150.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/81MsOLYt48L._UF1000_1000_QL80.jpg?v=1760713513"},{"product_id":"harry-and-the-bucketful-of-dinosaurs-9-books","title":"Harry and the Bucketful of Dinosaurs 9 Books","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"223\" data-end=\"500\"\u003eStep into the magical world of Harry and his six toy dinosaurs—Taury, Trike, Patsy, Pterence, Sid, and Steggy. With a single jump into his bucket, Harry brings his dinosaurs to life, and together they embark on wild, fun-filled adventures that spark imagination and laughter.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"993\"\u003eThis special collection of 9 enchanting stories follows Harry and his dinosaur friends through snow-covered kingdoms, messy swamps, exciting school days, museum mysteries, and even a heartwarming Christmas wish. From stomping through puddles to learning lessons about friendship, curiosity, and courage, every story is packed with humor, adventure, and heart. Young readers will love joining Harry on every thrilling journey, and parents will enjoy watching their imaginations take flight.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1025\"\u003eIncluded in this collection:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1377\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1066\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1066\"\u003eHarry and the Bucketful of Dinosaurs\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1094\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1094\"\u003eHarry and the Snow King\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1135\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1135\"\u003eHarry and the Dinosaurs Go to School\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1181\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1181\"\u003eHarry and the Dinosaurs Romp in the Swamp\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1223\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1223\"\u003eHarry and the Dinosaurs Make a Splash\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1260\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1260\"\u003eHarry and the Dinosaurs Say Raah\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1302\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1302\"\u003eHarry and the Dinosaurs in the Museum\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1327\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1327\"\u003eHarry and the Robots\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1377\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1377\"\u003eHarry and the Dinosaurs Make a Christmas Wish\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1580\"\u003ePerfect for children aged 4-8, this collection is ideal for bedtime stories, classroom reading, or anytime young readers want to explore a world where toys come to life and every day is an adventure.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1624\"\u003eAuthor: Ian Whybrow\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1657\"\u003eIllustrator: Adrian Reynolds\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1707\"\u003eFormat: Paperback \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"1738\"\u003ePages: Approx. 32 per book\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1763\"\u003eAge Range: 4-8 years\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1763\"\u003eISBN: \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45803742167193,"sku":"13RA8765432","price":180.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_38cd1cd3-0695-4058-8026-e9e7aba44245.jpg?v=1760810108"},{"product_id":"a-child-s-first-library-of-values-volumes-1-to-15-total-development-program","title":"A Child’s First Library of Values – Volumes 1 to 15 (Total Development Program)","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"85\" data-end=\"461\"\u003eThere are books that teach children to read — and then there are books that teach them \u003cem data-start=\"172\" data-end=\"185\"\u003ehow to live\u003c\/em\u003e.\u003cbr data-start=\"186\" data-end=\"189\"\u003eA Child’s First Library of Values is part of ETL’s famous Total Development Program — a beautifully illustrated, heartwarming 15-volume collection that helps children discover kindness, honesty, courage, respect, and empathy through timeless stories from around the world.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"827\"\u003eEach book tells a short, value-driven tale, perfectly written for curious young minds and early readers. From tales of honesty that make you smile, to gentle reminders about sharing and helping others, this series builds character one story at a time. It’s not just a reading set — it’s a childhood companion that shapes the way kids think, feel, and treat others.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"1092\"\u003eIdeal for bedtime stories, classroom reading, or family bonding moments, these books make learning values a joyful adventure. The vibrant illustrations, simple language, and thoughtful morals make it easy for children to relate, reflect, and grow with every page.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1182\" data-start=\"1117\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1182\" data-start=\"1119\"\u003eComplete 15-volume collection covering essential moral values\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1267\" data-start=\"1183\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1267\" data-start=\"1185\"\u003eCarefully curated stories that nurture empathy, honesty, kindness, and gratitude\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1345\" data-start=\"1268\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1345\" data-start=\"1270\"\u003eEasy-to-read text and captivating illustrations for children aged 3 to 10\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1416\" data-start=\"1346\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1416\" data-start=\"1348\"\u003eDeveloped by ETL Learning as part of the Total Development Program\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1493\" data-start=\"1417\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1493\" data-start=\"1419\"\u003eGreat for family reading time, classrooms, and early character education\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese aren’t just storybooks — they’re stepping stones toward raising confident, compassionate, and thoughtful children\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45809400250521,"sku":"3RA324568","price":300.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_08dd6791-0b9f-4703-8e1f-17d349d3a596.jpg?v=1761057334"},{"product_id":"learning-math-with-albert-levels-1-to-10","title":"Learning Math with Albert – Levels 1 to 10","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"274\" data-end=\"551\"\u003eIntroduce your child to the world of mathematics with the Learning Math with Albert series. Designed for young learners, this comprehensive program takes children from basic concepts to more advanced mathematical skills, all while keeping the learning process fun and engaging.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"793\"\u003eEach level builds upon the previous one, ensuring a solid foundation in math. Through colorful illustrations and relatable scenarios, children will learn to recognize numbers, understand basic operations, and develop problem-solving skills.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"981\"\u003eIdeal for parents seeking to enhance their child's mathematical abilities at an early age, this series offers a structured approach to learning that aligns with developmental milestones.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1007\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1066\"\u003eTitle: Learning Math with Albert – Levels 1 to 10\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1124\"\u003ePublisher: Educational Technologies Limited (ETL)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1175\"\u003eSeries: Total Development Program – Skills\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1207\"\u003eFormat: Hardcover Books\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1233\"\u003eLanguage: English\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45809410179225,"sku":"3RA456","price":200.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_c7b4119e-2172-4232-877a-f9cd83c10709.jpg?v=1761058092"},{"product_id":"english-time-level-1-10-total-development-program-skills","title":"English Time Level 1–10 – Total Development Program (Skills)","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"291\" data-end=\"562\"\u003eEmbark on a captivating journey to English proficiency with the English Time series. Designed for young learners, this comprehensive 10-level program introduces children to the English language through engaging stories, interactive activities, and colorful illustrations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"846\"\u003eEach level builds upon the previous one, ensuring a structured progression from basic vocabulary and sentence structures to more complex language concepts. The series emphasizes listening, speaking, reading, and writing skills, providing a holistic approach to language acquisition.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"1010\"\u003eIdeal for children aged 3 to 8, the English Time series offers a fun and systematic way to master English, laying a strong foundation for future academic success.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1076\"\u003eTitle: English Time Level 1–10\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1134\"\u003ePublisher: Educational Technologies Limited (ETL)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1185\"\u003eSeries: Total Development Program – Skills\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1217\"\u003eFormat: Hardcover Books\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1243\"\u003eLanguage: English\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45809414799513,"sku":"3RA398762","price":200.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/IMG_20251021_185057.jpg?v=1761058575"},{"product_id":"total-development-program-knowledge-series-volumes-1-24","title":"Total Development Program – Knowledge Series (Volumes 1–24)","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"693\"\u003eIntroduce your child to a world of knowledge with the Total Development Program – Knowledge Series. This carefully structured 24-volume collection is designed to nurture curiosity, build understanding, and encourage exploration across multiple subjects. Each volume takes children on a journey of discovery, from learning about themselves and life, to understanding nature, science, and the world around them.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"743\"\u003eThe series is divided into four thematic sets:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"1056\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"811\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"811\"\u003eLife 1–6: Exploring personal growth, health, habits, and values\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"877\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"877\"\u003eNature 7–12: Discovering plants, animals, and the environment\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"965\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"965\"\u003eScience 13–18: Understanding basic scientific concepts, experiments, and principles\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1056\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1056\"\u003eOur World 19–24: Learning about geography, cultures, communities, and global awareness\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1346\"\u003eThrough engaging stories, colorful illustrations, and interactive activities, children are encouraged to ask questions, think critically, and develop a lifelong love for learning. The series is suitable for children aged 3–10 and supports foundational knowledge and cognitive development.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1444\"\u003eTitle: Total Development Program – Knowledge Series (Volumes 1–24)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1498\"\u003ePublisher: Educational Technologies Limited (ETL)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1526\"\u003eFormat: Hardcover Books\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1548\"\u003eLanguage: English\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1746\"\u003eSeries Themes: Life (1–6), Nature (7–12), Science (13–18), Our World (19–24)\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45809428922521,"sku":"9RA98765","price":450.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/IMG_20251021_191003.jpg?v=1761059850"},{"product_id":"total-development-program-skills-series-volumes-1-17","title":"Total Development Program – Skills Series (Volumes 1–17)","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"235\" data-end=\"566\"\u003eThe Total Development Program – Skills Series is a thoughtfully designed 17-volume collection that nurtures essential skills in young learners. From language and math to critical thinking, creativity, and problem-solving, this series provides a well-rounded approach to building abilities that support academic and personal growth.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"908\"\u003eEach volume focuses on a specific skill area, allowing children to progress systematically while reinforcing prior learning. Engaging activities, colorful illustrations, and interactive exercises make learning fun and practical. The series is suitable for children aged 3–10 and is perfect for home learning, classroom use, or guided study.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"934\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"1003\"\u003eTitle: Total Development Program – Skills Series (Volumes 1–17)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1057\"\u003ePublisher: Educational Technologies Limited (ETL)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1085\"\u003eFormat: Hardcover Books\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1107\"\u003eLanguage: English\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45809456316569,"sku":"3RA235","price":300.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/IMG_20251021_191748.jpg?v=1761060099"},{"product_id":"ripley-s-twists-set-of-5-books","title":"Ripley’s Twists (Set of 5 Books)","description":"\u003cp data-end=\"337\" data-start=\"34\"\u003eGet ready to twist your brain and tickle your curiosity! The Ripley’s Twists book set is where science meets the seriously strange. Perfect for kids (and secretly, adults) who love to ask “why?”, these books turn weird facts into wow moments — from outer space mysteries to the wild wonders of nature.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"544\" data-start=\"339\"\u003eEach page bursts with full-color photos, fun experiments, unbelievable truths, and that classic Ripley’s “Believe It or Not!” energy. It’s educational, entertaining, and just the right amount of bonkers.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"713\" data-start=\"546\"\u003eWhether you’re diving deep into Extreme Earth, exploring The Human Body, or blasting off into Space, these books make learning feel like an adventure — not homework.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1015\" data-start=\"715\"\u003eWhat’s inside:\u003cbr data-end=\"732\" data-start=\"729\"\u003eA set of 5 Ripley’s Twists titles ( Space, Sports,  Human Body, Extreme Earth, and Wild Animals)\u003cbr data-end=\"886\" data-start=\"883\"\u003ePacked with facts, quizzes, and eye-popping photos\u003cbr data-end=\"939\" data-start=\"936\"\u003eIdeal for ages 7–12\u003cbr data-end=\"961\" data-start=\"958\"\u003ePerfect for school projects or curious minds at home\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1195\" data-start=\"1017\"\u003eWhy you’ll love it:\u003cbr data-end=\"1039\" data-start=\"1036\"\u003eMakes learning science fun and hands-on\u003cbr data-end=\"1081\" data-start=\"1078\"\u003eEncourages curiosity, exploration, and critical thinking\u003cbr data-end=\"1140\" data-start=\"1137\"\u003eA great gift for budding scientists and trivia lovers\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-is-only-node=\"\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-end=\"1412\" data-start=\"1197\"\u003eProduct details:\u003cbr data-end=\"1216\" data-start=\"1213\"\u003eFormat: Paperback (Set of 5)\u003cbr data-end=\"1247\" data-start=\"1244\"\u003ePublisher: Ripley Publishing\u003cbr data-end=\"1278\" data-start=\"1275\"\u003eISBN: 9781609911320 (varies by title)\u003cbr data-end=\"1318\" data-start=\"1315\"\u003eLanguage: English\u003cbr data-end=\"1338\" data-start=\"1335\"\u003eDimensions: Approx. 22 × 15 cm per book\u003cbr data-end=\"1380\" data-start=\"1377\"\u003ePages: Around 48 pages per title\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45820745121945,"sku":"14RA34324","price":50.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_bfe4cd95-ad84-4e72-aefb-e071c71401f8.jpg?v=1761231252"},{"product_id":"fallen-trilogy-3-book-set-by-lauren-kate","title":"Fallen Trilogy (3 Book Set) by Lauren Kate","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"180\"\u003eA love so forbidden, it defies Heaven itself. Step into the hauntingly beautiful world of Fallen by Lauren Kate — a gothic romance where angels, mortals, and cursed love collide.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"484\"\u003eWhen Luce Price is sent to Sword \u0026amp; Cross reform school, she meets Daniel Grigori — mysterious, distant, and somehow heartbreakingly familiar. She doesn’t know it yet, but Daniel is a fallen angel, and their love has been cursed to repeat through centuries — doomed to end in tragedy, again and again.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"721\"\u003eThis three-book set sweeps you through a saga of eternal love, celestial battles, and dark secrets buried deep in time. Every page drips with passion and suspense — perfect for fans of Twilight, Hush Hush, and The Mortal Instruments.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"799\"\u003eDive into the story where love never dies… it just falls, again and again.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"1107\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003eBook Details:\u003cbr data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"817\"\u003eAuthor: Lauren Kate\u003cbr data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"839\"\u003eTitles Included: Fallen, Torment, Passion\u003cbr data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"883\"\u003eFormat: Paperback\u003cbr data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"966\"\u003eGenre: Young Adult, Fantasy, Romance\u003cbr data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1005\"\u003ePublisher: Corgi \/ Random House\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45838295105689,"sku":"12RA32323","price":60.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/71Dcd8T18_L._UF1000_1000_QL80.jpg?v=1761667871"},{"product_id":"the-promised-neverland-manga-volumes-1-to-11","title":"The Promised Neverland Manga – Volumes 1 to 11","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"573\"\u003eStep into a world of mystery, suspense, and clever survival with \u003cem data-start=\"267\" data-end=\"291\"\u003eThe Promised Neverland\u003c\/em\u003e. Follow Emma, Norman, and Ray as they uncover the dark secret behind Grace Field House and hatch daring plans to escape before it’s too late. With twists, strategies, and heart-pounding tension, this manga series keeps readers on the edge of their seats from start to finish.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"686\"\u003eThis set includes volumes 1 to 11 — perfect for collectors and fans who want to dive deep into the story.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"731\"\u003eFormat: Manga, Paperback\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"749\"\u003eVolumes: 1–11\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"771\"\u003eLanguage: English\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"825\"\u003eGenre: Dark Fantasy, Mystery, Thriller, Adventure\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45878943187097,"sku":"11RA313132","price":220.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_f9295ab9-633e-425c-a826-420e75d3d514.jpg?v=1762791324"}],"url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/collections\/series.oembed","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}